{"step_index":67,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T15:11:19Z","thinking":"**Understanding the Export Responsibility**\n\nThe task involves enhancing the reliability and usability of customer data exports. It includes large workspaces, while maintaining original timing and scope of the exports. The product lead, Sam, is the owner of this task, which is currently active.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python3 -c '\nimport os, glob\n\naction_files = glob.glob(\"/workspace/product/history/actions/*.md\")\n\nlarge_export_actions = []\nother_responsibilities = set()\n\nfor f in sorted(action_files):\n    with open(f) as fh:\n        text = fh.read()\n        if \"Originating responsibility\" not in text:\n            large_export_actions.append((f, text.strip()))\n        else:\n            for line in text.splitlines():\n                if \"Originating responsibility:\" in line:\n                    resp = line.split(\"Originating responsibility:\")[1].split(\".\")[0].strip()\n                    other_responsibilities.add(resp)\n                    if \"large-export\" in resp:\n                        large_export_actions.append((f, text.strip()))\n\nprint(\"Other responsibilities found:\", other_responsibilities)\nprint(f\"\\nFound {len(large_export_actions)} large-export / non-attributed actions:\")\nfor f, text in large_export_actions:\n    print(\"FILE:\", f)\n    print(text)\n    print(\"=\" * 50)\n'","Cwd":"/workspace","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Finding large-export actions","toolSummary":"Find large-export actions"}}]}
